  <collaboration id="Id_b43cacd3-8a1a-4350-b54e-f33317cb4bfa" name="SP 1. Formalização da Demanda">
    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_StartFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_EndFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Processo de elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do DFD - Documento de Formaliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da Demanda.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
    <participant id="Id_893de64d-ac97-4e7b-80b7-ef054104d853" name="Processo principal" processRef="Id_e0670ddd-43bd-415d-bcf0-6c57b4805a53">
      <documentation />
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#FFFFFF" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="isMainParticipant" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
    </participant>
    <participant id="Id_0cf9968f-aaaa-473a-b750-9611acf5abc1" name="Processo de Obras Públicas - FNDE/MEC e Municípios - SP1. DFD" processRef="Id_fb8dc95c-b3a9-4685-acfa-32097e8f35aa">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_StartFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Decreto n&amp;ordm; 10.947, de 25 de janeiro de 2022. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Regulamenta o inciso VII do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;do art. 12 da Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133, de 1&amp;ordm; de abril de 2021, para dispor sobre o plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual e instituir o Sistema de Planejamento e Gerenciamento de Contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es no &amp;acirc;mbito da administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o p&amp;uacute;blica federal direta, aut&amp;aacute;rquica e fundacional.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 8&amp;ordm; &amp;nbsp;Para elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual, o requisitante preencher&amp;aacute; o documento de formaliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de demanda no PGC com as seguintes informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8i"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - justificativa da necessidade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8ii"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;II - descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o sucinta do objeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8iii"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;III - quantidade a ser contratada, quando couber, considerada a expectativa de consumo anual;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8iv"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;IV - estimativa preliminar do valor da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, por meio de procedimento simplificado, de acordo com as orienta&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es da Secretaria de Gest&amp;atilde;o da Secretaria Especial de Desburocratiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, Gest&amp;atilde;o e Governo Digital do Minist&amp;eacute;rio da Economia;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8v"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da data pretendida para a conclus&amp;atilde;o da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, a fim de n&amp;atilde;o gerar preju&amp;iacute;zos ou descontinuidade das atividades do &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o ou da entidade;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8vi"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VI - grau de prioridade da compra ou da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o em baixo, m&amp;eacute;dio ou alto, de acordo com a metodologia estabelecida pelo &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o ou pela entidade contratante;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8vii"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VII - indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de vincula&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou depend&amp;ecirc;ncia com o objeto de outro documento de formaliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de demanda para a sua execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, com vistas a determinar a sequ&amp;ecirc;ncia em que as contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es ser&amp;atilde;o realizadas; e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="art8viii"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;VIII - nome da &amp;aacute;rea requisitante ou t&amp;eacute;cnica com a identifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do respons&amp;aacute;vel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_EndFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#F2F2F2" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#A2A2A2" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
    </participant>
  </collaboration>
